# music/ is an allowlist, not a blocklist: only the tracks cleared for publishing are named here,
# so nothing else in the folder can reach the repo by accident. Lyrics stay out — the .lrc files are
# the original songs' words, and they are not ours to ship.
music/*
!music/manifest.json
!music/Jadog - Superpowers (Night Remix).mp3
!music/Jadog - 記得 Remember (Intimate Remix).mp3

